# Western & Eastern Plaguelands (56-58): the Bulwark, Andorhal, Light's Hope and the Scarlet and
# Scourge camps of both Plaguelands, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/western_eastern_plaguelands_56_58.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Western Plaguelands, area
# 28, and Eastern Plaguelands, area 139). The guide's quest list is section 22 of
# addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Data fixed here: most Eastern Plaguelands spawns from Wowhead use an older map of the zone
# (x about 1.11 * x + 1.7, y about 1.10 * y + 4.6 of today's), so the places of its NPCs and mobs
# are given by hand with "at" (Tirion Fordring, Nathanos Blightcaller, Caretaker Alen...).
# Locked Away: the outhouse (5059, repeatable) comes before the cabinet (5060). Opening the outhouse
#   with the Dalson Outhouse Key hands 5059 in and calls Farmer Dalson, who drops the Dalson Cabinet
#   Key that 5060 wants (Wowhead, WoW Forever quest 5060, comments of 2019-09-18 and 2019-11-02:
#   "use it on Outhouse it will spawn mob, kill him, get new key"; outof.games lists 5059 at the
#   outhouse, 48.1,49.7). outof.games lists no quest before 5060, only level 52, but the key comes
#   only after 5059, so the guide does 5059 first and keeps the data's 5059 prerequisite.
# Added: River Ends (7790) and Rapid Escape (8152), the start of the Argent Arbiter chain (outof.games;
# the data marks them removed). Rapid Escape is handed in to the Argent Medic at Light's Hope.
# Carried in from Felwood & Winterspring (54-56): Andron's Payment to Jediga (3564, from Andron Gant
# in Undercity), The Everlook Report (6029), Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff (6030) and Sister Pamela (5601),
# from Everlook.
# Left to later guides: Glyphed Oaken Branch (4987, Thunder Bluff) and Taking Back Silithus (8276).
# The Champion of the Banshee Queen (5961): Sylvanas' errand to Nathanos, taken in Undercity at the
#   start and handed in at Marris Stead.
# Optional, for a group: The Archivist (5251, Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope) and The Truth
#   Comes Crashing Down (5262, the Head of Balnazzar), both in the living half of Stratholme, on the
#   last visit of the Eastern Plaguelands; handed in at Light's Hope after Tyr's Hand. Above and
#   Beyond (5263) after them is left out. Menethil's Gift (5463) is left out too: it needs The Dying,
#   Ras Frostwhisper (5462), the middle of a Scholomance chain no guide follows.
# A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! is taken from Harbinger Balthazad in Undercity (5094); the same
#   quest from Thunder Bluff (5095) and Orgrimmar (5093) is passed by the addon once 5094 is done.
#
# The route: Undercity (the auction house) and the Bulwark; four loops from the Bulwark
# (the Scarlet tent; Felstone, Dalson's Tears and Andorhal; Dalson's cauldron; the Writhing Haunt,
# Northridge and Hearthglen); up the Thondroril River into the Eastern Plaguelands: Tirion, Nathanos,
# Darrowshire, Corin's Crossing, Light's Hope, the north and Plaguewood, back to the south-west; the
# hearthstone to Undercity; the second visit of the Western Plaguelands (Janice, Marlene, Chromie,
# Gahrron's Withering); Light's Hope and the north-east; Caer Darrow, Andorhal, Hearthglen and the
# Bulwark; Undercity and the flight to Light's Hope for the Noxious Glade and Nathanos' Scarlet
# missions; Chromie and the Battle of Darrowshire; Undercity, Orgrimmar and Azshara.

guide Western & Eastern Plaguelands (56-58)
faction horde
levels 56 58
carry 1123 3564 5601 6029 6030
leave 1123 4987 8276
next Winterspring (58-59)

